  "notes": "Concept matching supplied renders. Joined lifting centerbody and anhedral wings. Shared planform AR is a strip-theory approximation, not validated 3-D blended-wing aerodynamics. Nominal masses and inertias are assumptions. Fixed EDF force directions; no moving surfaces. Ground supports are temporary simulator launch/landing supports for the pitched hover attitude, not engineered landing gear. Adjacent fixed jetfoil groups have different forward angles to increase differential-thrust yaw authority."
